---
import StarlightPage from '@astrojs/starlight/components/StarlightPage.astro'
import RecoveryNavigator from '../../islands/RecoveryNavigator'
import { loadManifest } from '@universe/inscribe-learning'

const manifest = loadManifest()
---

<StarlightPage frontmatter={{ title: 'Recovery Navigator', description: 'Answer a few questions about your situation and get a diagnosis with the exact next action, stop conditions, and what not to do.', slug: 'recovery/navigator' }}>
  <noscript>
    <section class="ins-lab">
      <h2>Recovery without JavaScript</h2>
      <p>The interactive navigator needs JavaScript. The authoritative static reference is the <a href="/docs-inscribe/safety/order-recovery/">order recovery guide</a>, which lists every interrupted state with its next action.</p>
      <p><strong>Standing rules:</strong> never pay twice on a hunch; top up differences, never repeat totals; a confirmed transaction is final for everyone; never publish a recovery kit; never act on stale data.</p>
      <p>The navigator covers {manifest.recovery.outcomes.length} terminal states, from unpaid orders to irreversible wrong-address sends.</p>
    </section>
  </noscript>
  <RecoveryNavigator client:load />
</StarlightPage>
